{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UrvBm1ue64Mcz5JTsAe4V3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/cross_representation_disagreement_diagno/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 14\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：FOLIO + Qwen3-32B + FOL/Python 双表征验证分歧诊断假设\\\\n  rationale: 选择 FOLIO 因为：(1) 逻辑推理任务天然适合 FOL+Z3 表征，同时也可写 Python 约束代码，双路径互补性最强；(2) 数据集较小（~200条），MVP\\\\n    成本低；(3) 已有 ground truth label，可直接评估诊断准确性。选择 Qwen3-32B thinking mode 因为：(1) IDEA_BRIEF\\\\n    指定的主模型；(2) Apache 2.0 开源；(3) Qwen Cloud API 价格低（$0.08/M input）。Pass/fail 标准：分歧率≥10%、诊断信息量≥40%、≥2种错误类型、定向修复>盲目重生成。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 反馈修订 MVP：增加 Step 0 baseline 门控、C4≥5pp、C5 定位准确率≥60%、灰色区间规则\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出四个有效问题：(1) C4 无量化阈值可能放行无意义差异→加≥5pp；(2) C1/C2 灰色地带未定义→灰色区间扩展到第二数据集；(3)\\\\n    Qwen3-32B FOLIO baseline 未知，若>90%错误样本不足→增加 Step 0 前置测试；(4) 错误定位是核心环节但未纳入 MVP→增加\\\\n    C5 定位准确率≥60%。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 增加 post-MVP 时间骨架和 MVP fail 应急方案（FOLIO fail→ProofWriter→Qwen3-8B→kill）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 ROADMAP 缺少 MVP 后阶段规划和 fail 应急方案。11 天 DDL 下任何决策延迟代价极高。时间骨架仅为粗粒度分配（不是详细研究规划），fail\\\\n    路径按成本递增排列：换数据集(低成本)→换模型(中成本)→kill(止损)。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: 回退 qwen3.6-plus → 要求 Qwen3-32B 或同级开源模型，Reviewer critical 判定\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出两个 critical 问题：(1) qwen3.6-plus 是闭源 API 模型，EMNLP 要求可复现性；(2)\\\\n    模型能力远超 Qwen3-32B（GPQA Diamond 88% vs 66.8%），FOLIO baseline 可能>90%导致错误样本不足，headroom\\\\n    story 不成立。Agent 无权自行做核心方法论变更（模型选择是 IDEA_BRIEF 设计决策），必须上报 Director。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮未通过（2/5），根因是 Z3 prompt 质量（78% crash），非假设失败。启动 iteration 2 修复 prompt\\\\n  rationale: FOL 路径 78% exec_crash 导致真分歧样本极少（4%），修复优势为负（-28pp）。但 baseline 74% 确认 FOLIO\\\\n    是合适的数据集、headroom 充足。Code 路径 52% accuracy 表明 Python 表征可行。核心问题是 Z3 代码生成质量——加 few-shot\\\\n    examples + 输出验证预期可大幅降低 crash 率。Day 4 硬截止前有足够时间做 1-2 次 prompt 迭代。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_001\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 74% accuracy, PASS_FOLIO\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_001\\\\n    role: mvp_v1\\\\n    result: NOT PASSED 2/5, FOL 78% crash\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP v2 结果：FOL crash 78%→10%、C4/C5 翻转为 PASS，但 Code crash 40% 需修复后迭代 v3\\\\n  rationale: Few-shot + syntax fix 大幅改善 FOL 侧（accuracy 14%→90%）。C4 从 -28pp 翻转为 +40pp，C5\\\\n    从 42% 翻转为 100%。新瓶颈是 Python Code 侧 thinking token 泄漏导致 40% crash，压缩了有效双表征样本量。C1=0%\\\\n    在仅 10 条中不具统计意义，修复 Code crash 后扩大样本是关键。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_002\\\\n    role: mvp_v2_test10\\\\n    result: FOL crash 10%, Code crash 40%, C1=0%, C4=+40pp, C5=100%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 撤回 v5 closed-world 方案，改为 v5b：保持 3-way 输出但改进 prompt 减少 lazy Unknown\\\\n  rationale: v5 强制 Code 路径 closed-world 2-way 输出，而 FOL 保持 open-world 3-way。FOLIO ~39%\\\\n    GT=Unknown，导致这些样本上 FOL=Unknown vs Code=False 的人为 disagreement。审稿人会质疑分歧信号有多少来自语义假设差异而非推理错误。正确做法：保持两条路径同一语义基础（都\\\\n    3-way），通过改进 few-shot 和指令减少\\\\\\\"不敢判断就输出 Unknown\\\\\\\"的 lazy 行为。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: running, 41/204, Code Unknown rate 46.3%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: repair.py prompt bug 确认为 C4 下降根因，修复后 repair-only 重跑全量 204 样本\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 BLIND_REGEN_PROMPT 和 TARGETED_REPAIR_PROMPT 硬编码 \\\\\\\"Python script\\\\\\\"，FOL(Z3)\\\\n    修复时给模型矛盾指令，导致 FOL-side targeted repair 50% vs blind 90%（-40pp）。C4 从 +22.6→+7.4\\\\n    的下降趋势直接由此解释。修复方案：动态 repr_type 替换硬编码，pipeline 完成后对全部 204 样本仅重跑 repair+eval 阶段得到干净可比数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: C4 All-mode +7.4pp (suppressed by bug), C4 excl-Unknown +0.0pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 05:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 通过 MVP gate，C4 作为已知弱点进入 research 阶段解决\\\\n  rationale: All-mode 5/5 PASS（原始+repair后均通过）。核心假设（跨表征分歧→诊断→定位）由 C1(39.6%), C2(86.8%),\\\\n    C3(3 types), C5(85.4%) 强力支持。C4 技术上通过（+5.2pp > 5pp）但 margin 仅 0.2pp，Excl-Unknown\\\\n    组 0.0pp，统计上不显著。C4 弱点是 paper framing 问题而非方法论根本缺陷——repair 是下游应用，核心贡献在 diagnosis+localization。Research\\\\n    阶段需要：(1) 改进 repair 机制拉大 delta，或 (2) reframe paper 弱化 repair claim 聚焦 diagnosis+localization。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: All-mode 5/5 PASS, C4 margin 0.2pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: D008 假设（prompt bug = C4 根因）未获支撑；C4 reframe 为 error-type-conditional advantage\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 统计分析：修复前后仅 3/192 次结果翻转（targeted +1, blind +2），blind 改善多于 targeted，C4\\\\n    delta 反而从 +6.25pp 降到 +5.2pp。C4 aggregate +5.2pp 的 p≈0.23 无统计显著性。但 Unknown 子组 +13.5pp\\\\n    (T:23/37 vs B:18/37) 显示诊断信号在系统性错误（Code overclaiming）上有效，非 Unknown 组 +0.0pp 显示对随机推理错误无效。C4\\\\n    弱不是 bug 导致的，是方法论层面的 error-type-dependent 局限。Paper framing Claim 3 已更新：不 claim\\\\n    aggregate repair superiority，claim conditional advantage + boundary characterization。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: C4 aggregate +5.2pp (p≈0.23), Unknown +13.5pp, non-Unknown +0.0pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 统一指标为 per-sample 计算；Claim 3 更新为 GT-label-dependent 三分效应（Unknown +14.7pp\\\\n    / False +6.7pp / True -13.6pp）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 evaluate_mvp.py (per-side) 和 deep_analysis.py (per-sample)\\\\n    两套指标不一致。per-sample 更贴合论文叙事（每个问题一个诊断），选为标准。GT=True 子组发现 targeted repair 反效果 -13.6pp（blind\\\\n    77.3% vs targeted 63.6%），不只是\\\\\\\"无帮助\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"有害\\\\\\\"。Claim 3 从 \\\\\\\"conditional advantage\\\\\\\" 升级为\\\\n    \\\\\\\"GT-label-dependent three-way split\\\\\\\"——这是更有价值的发现。5.6:1 不对称性（非 9:1）已修正到 framing。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: GT=True -13.6pp, GT=False +6.7pp, GT=Unknown +14.7pp. Asymmetry 5.6:1.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: C5 报告双指标：C5-committed (85.4%, 仅明确预测) + C5-coverage (53.0%, 含 ambiguous=fail)；D009\\\\n    MVP 判定维持\\\\n  rationale: evaluate_mvp.py 过滤 ambiguous 预测 → C5=85.4% (35/41)；evaluate_unified.py\\\\n    不过滤 → C5=53.0% (35/66)。差异根因是 38% 样本 stability test 返回 ambiguous。两个视角都有效：committed\\\\n    衡量\\\\\\\"做了预测时的精度\\\\\\\"，coverage 衡量\\\\\\\"整体覆盖率\\\\\\\"。论文应诚实报告两个数字。D009 MVP 使用 C5-committed，判定维持——localization\\\\n    的 coverage 局限是已知弱点，不否定核心假设（分歧作为诊断信号）。GT=Unknown C5=35.7% 但 C4=+14.7pp 的悖论说明修复效用来自\\\\n    disagreement pattern（信息含量）而非 error_side 定位精度——这本身是有价值的发现。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: C5-committed 85.4% (35/41), C5-coverage 53.0% (35/66), ambiguous rate\\\\n      38%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #1 三档均 3/6 (borderline/weak reject)，识别 5 个结构性问题，更新 framing+plan\\\\n    后 re-dream'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260515T060408 三档评分: Best=3/6 borderline reject, Median=3/6\\\\n    weak reject, Worst=3/6 borderline reject。未达 \\\\\\\"best ≥ weak accept\\\\\\\" 门槛。跨三档一致的结构性问题:\\\\n    (1) Related work 严重不足——缺 self-consistency/LEVER/Faithful CoT/self-debug/multi-agent\\\\n    debate; (2) 引用不完整; (3) Error taxonomy 未验证; (4) \\\\\\\"first systematic study\\\\\\\" claim\\\\n    过强; (5) 缺 self-consistency baseline 对比。已采取行动: paper_framing.md 降低 novelty claim\\\\n    + 加 R8-R11 reviewer concerns; experiment_plan.yaml 新增 exp-012 (self-consistency\\\\n    baseline, P0) + exp-013 (taxonomy cross-validation, P1) + exp-007 升 P0。需 re-dream\\\\n    验证改进效果后才能批准 P0 实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: 新增 P0 — self-consistency baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: 新增 P1 — taxonomy validation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: P1→P0 升级 — selection vs repair\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 7500, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SWJw8rXGZ5rKirMWqkE2oY","session_id":"ab842f09-8098-40e4-9c77-da694f398589","uuid":"a7dd68cf-a81e-424b-97ea-e4ee2710c3dd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:03:08.642Z"}
